repository-code: "https://github.com/crystal-warden/prism-path"
abstract: >-
  A workflow format and reference implementation in which the control flow of LLM-agent
  systems is a human-authored Markdown document: a routing spectrum of four edge tiers
  (deterministic predicates, embedding-with-LLM-escalation semantics, error, event), a
  decidable static-analysis pass, a routing lockfile, risk-controlled escalation calibration,
  durable execution with a git proof-ledger, a machine-checkable conformance-vector suite,
  and a dependency-free portable kernel for the ML-free subset.
keywords:
  - llm-agents
  - workflow-orchestration
  - markdown
  - routing
  - declarative
